836
00:40:19,666 --> 00:40:21,200
I think

837
00:40:21,233 --> 00:40:23,433
Vinson's a really emotional person.

838
00:40:23,433 --> 00:40:24,566
He's got stories inside him.

839
00:40:25,600 --> 00:40:28,633
I feel I really connected with the song.

840
00:40:29,500 --> 00:40:32,500
I could step into his world.

841
00:40:36,433 --> 00:40:38,866
I can feel the sadness
when a girl you like

842
00:40:38,866 --> 00:40:42,133
