848
00:40:58,200 --> 00:40:59,500
I think I can do it now.

849
00:41:09,233 --> 00:41:11,066
I just want to sing it to her tonight.

850
00:41:11,066 --> 00:41:12,166
Whatever happens,

851
00:41:13,066 --> 00:41:14,300
I want to tell everyone

852
00:41:14,300 --> 00:41:16,833
