It's cute.

926
00:43:53,333 --> 00:43:54,266
[Cute]
Let's do it faster.

927
00:43:54,300 --> 00:43:54,700
Hi everyone!

928
00:43:54,700 --> 00:43:56,000
We're Huihui.

929
00:43:56,033 --> 00:43:56,733
Tengteng.

930
00:43:56,733 --> 00:43:57,433
Tengteng.

931
00:43:57,466 --> 00:43:58,733
[I'm a stand-in now?]

932
00:43:59,466 --> 00:44:00,166
Why did I say your name?

933
00:44:03,266 --> 00:44:03,800
Again.

934
00:44:03,833 --> 00:44:04,133
Hi everyone!

935
00:44:04,133 --> 00:44:05,000
We're Huihui.

936
00:44:05,033 --> 00:44:05,366
Taotao.

937
00:44:05,400 --> 00:44:06,133
And Tengeng.

938
00:44:06,133 --> 00:44:07,966
Coming up is our dance mashup.

939
00:44:18,733 --> 00:44:19,133
Look.

940
00:44:19,133 --> 00:44:20,266
So basically,

941
00:44:20,300 --> 00:44:21,833
