977
00:46:19,433 --> 00:46:20,300
What are we doing?

978
00:46:20,300 --> 00:46:20,900
What are we doing?

979
00:46:20,900 --> 00:46:21,533
What are we doing?

980
00:46:23,100 --> 00:46:25,200
