1035
00:48:20,200 --> 00:48:21,466
Yeah, that would be...

1036
00:48:21,466 --> 00:48:22,466
Yesterday, I said...

1037
00:48:22,466 --> 00:48:24,300
But Qianyu did come back.

1038
00:48:24,300 --> 00:48:25,333
Yeah, she did.

1039
00:48:25,333 --> 00:48:26,066
So...

1040
00:48:27,433 --> 00:48:29,766
There's someone I want
to get to know better.

1041
00:48:29,800 --> 00:48:32,700
I'm not trying to influence your decision.

1042
00:48:32,700 --> 00:48:34,400
Let's say I'm you.

1043
00:48:34,433 --> 00:48:35,066
You went on a date

1044
00:48:35,066 --> 00:48:36,000
