1052
00:48:45,433 --> 00:48:46,333
No. I've always said

1053
00:48:46,333 --> 00:48:49,033
Qianyu and I are good friends.

1054
00:48:49,066 --> 00:48:50,333
[We've been friends from the beginning.]

1055
00:48:50,666 --> 00:48:52,600
You really don't feel anything for her?

1056
00:48:54,233 --> 00:48:56,300
Qianyu is really...

1057
00:48:56,300 --> 00:48:57,500
She's really a good girl.

1058
00:48:57,500 --> 00:48:58,333
Yeah. She is.

1059
00:49:08,700 --> 00:49:09,433
I'm just curious

1060
00:49:09,466 --> 00:49:10,200
