1077
00:49:55,100 --> 00:49:56,533
No.

1078
00:49:57,233 --> 00:49:58,466
She's great, though.

1079
00:49:58,466 --> 00:49:59,400
She really is.

1080
00:49:59,433 --> 00:50:00,133
Yeah.

1081
00:50:00,133 --> 00:50:00,800
I respect her.

1082
