1083
00:50:06,133 --> 00:50:06,966
Same here.

1084
00:50:10,900 --> 00:50:11,766
To be honest,

1085
00:50:11,800 --> 00:50:12,866
I only made my decision today

1086
00:50:12,866 --> 00:50:15,500
