1091
00:50:21,500 --> 00:50:23,500
Like all of a sudden.

1092
00:50:23,500 --> 00:50:24,933
You missed us, right?

1093
00:50:27,333 --> 00:50:28,166
Yeah.

1094
00:50:43,533 --> 00:50:44,766
The rain is so heavy.

1095
00:50:48,266 --> 00:50:49,100
Time to vote.

1096
00:50:50,400 --> 00:50:52,266
Attention, all islanders.

1097
