1110
00:52:05,933 --> 00:52:07,200
and I'm behind you,

1111
00:52:07,233 --> 00:52:07,900
I'm okay with that.

1112
00:52:07,900 --> 00:52:08,933
I'm always here.

1113
00:52:09,933 --> 00:52:12,533
[Vinson; Jerry Wang]

1114
00:52:21,666 --> 00:52:24,166
[Xia Boyan
gave Jerry 1 Moonstone.]

1115
00:52:31,433 --> 00:52:33,366
[Xia Boyan
gave Vinson 1 Moonstone.]

1116
00:52:36,333 --> 00:52:38,633
[Jerry Wang]

1117
00:52:40,900 --> 00:52:42,900
[Vinson]

1118
00:52:45,700 --> 00:52:48,400
[Xia Boyan
gave Vinson 2 Moonstones.]

1119
00:52:54,900 --> 00:52:56,733
[Pan Xiaoyi
You're gonna wait at the door?]

1120
00:52:56,733 --> 00:52:57,733
[Jerry Wang
I'll wait here for her.]

1121
00:52:57,733 --> 00:52:58,566
[Pan Xiaoyi
You can't see anything from here.]

1122
00:52:59,533 --> 00:53:00,933
[Let me see.]

1123
00:53:01,500 --> 00:53:02,900
[Path to Moonstone Voting]

1124
00:53:04,666 --> 00:53:06,466
[Waiting for Xiaxia Outside]

1125
00:53:11,200 --> 00:53:13,100
[Empty]

1126
00:53:25,100 --> 00:53:26,766
[Five Minutes Later]

1127
00:53:32,100 --> 00:53:33,433
[You can go vote now.]

1128
00:53:35,000 --> 00:53:36,100
[Waited for Nothing]

1129
00:53:36,100 --> 00:53:36,933
No way!

1130
00:53:36,933 --> 00:53:38,333
Wait, where is she?

1131
00:53:38,333 --> 00:53:39,566
[Where's Xiaxia?]

1132
00:53:39,600 --> 00:53:40,333
Let's go.

1133
00:53:40,333 --> 00:53:42,333
I didn't see her.

1134
00:53:42,333 --> 00:53:43,600
Did she float past?

1135
00:53:43,633 --> 00:53:45,933
Excuse me, did Xia Boyan vote yet?

1136
00:53:45,933 --> 00:53:47,566
Did Xia Boyan vote yet?

1137
00:53:47,600 --> 00:53:48,700
[She did.]

1138
00:53:48,700 --> 00:53:50,100
Did she vote?

1139
00:53:50,100 --> 00:53:51,900
We've been waiting here the whole time.

1140
00:53:51,900 --> 00:53:52,766
Did she walk by here?

1141
00:53:52,900 --> 00:53:53,300
[Yes]

1142
00:53:53,300 --> 00:53:54,200
[No way!]

1143
00:53:54,233 --> 00:53:55,900
I was standing right here.

1144
00:53:56,033 --> 00:53:57,166
[Waiting for Xiaxia]

1145
00:53:57,200 --> 00:53:59,066
That's insane. Like a ghost story.

1146
00:53:59,666 --> 00:54:00,900
Did she swim in from the ocean?

1147
00:54:00,900 --> 00:54:02,033
I don't buy it.

1148
00:54:02,066 --> 00:54:04,400
Xiaxia is like a little fairy,

1149
00:54:04,433 --> 00:54:04,700
you know?

1150
00:54:04,700 --> 00:54:06,533
She just pops up and disappears.

1151
00:54:06,533 --> 00:54:07,400
You can't catch her.

1152
00:54:07,433 --> 00:54:08,833
[Can't Catch Her]

1153
00:54:08,833 --> 00:54:10,033
That's not good.

1154
00:54:10,033 --> 00:54:10,766
And I said

1155
00:54:10,800 --> 00:54:13,333
I needed to see her today.

1156
00:54:13,333 --> 00:54:15,600
Bro, I'll walk with you.

1157
00:54:15,633 --> 00:54:16,833
[Brotherhood in the Heart]
We're gonna meet her

1158
00:54:16,833 --> 00:54:17,466
[Brotherhood in the Heart]

1159
00:54:17,466 --> 00:54:18,100
[Brotherhood in the Heart]
no matter what.

1160
00:54:19,033 --> 00:54:20,033
I see her.

1161
00:54:20,033 --> 00:54:20,566
Where?

1162
00:54:21,300 --> 00:54:22,766
[Finally Found you]
You stand up there.

1163
00:54:22,800 --> 00:54:23,233
Bro,

1164
00:54:23,233 --> 00:54:24,966
I'm leaving now.

1165
00:54:25,033 --> 00:54:26,266
[Mission Complete √]

1166
00:54:26,700 --> 00:54:27,500
Let me hold you up.

1167
00:54:27,500 --> 00:54:28,000
Wait!

1168
00:54:28,033 --> 00:54:29,633
[Don't leave, bro!]
She's with another girl.

1169
00:54:29,633 --> 00:54:30,300
Who is it?

1170
00:54:30,300 --> 00:54:31,633
I'll go chat with her.

1171
00:54:32,033 --> 00:54:33,266
[Trustworthy]
Alright.

1172
00:54:33,266 --> 00:54:34,133
Hello!

1173
00:54:36,200 --> 00:54:37,333
We were just saying

1174
00:54:37,333 --> 00:54:38,633
you two are like little fairies.

1175
00:54:38,666 --> 00:54:40,000
You show up out of nowhere

1176
00:54:40,033 --> 00:54:41,566
and vanish all of a sudden.

1177
00:54:41,600 --> 00:54:42,866
That's because we are fairies.

1178
00:54:42,866 --> 00:54:44,000
True.

1179
00:54:44,033 --> 00:54:45,666
You were nowhere to be found.

1180
00:54:46,033 --> 00:54:46,966
You looking for me?

1181
00:54:47,000 --> 00:54:47,933
[Extreme Assist Mode]
Just wanted to chat

1182
00:54:47,933 --> 00:54:48,966
[Extreme Assist Mode]
or take a walk with you.

1183
00:54:49,000 --> 00:54:49,900
[Extreme Assist Mode]
Sure.

1184
00:54:50,800 --> 00:54:51,300
No problem.

1185
00:54:51,300 --> 00:54:52,766
Can we walk with you?

1186
00:54:52,800 --> 00:54:53,533
Sure.

1187
00:54:53,533 --> 00:54:54,566
Let's go.

1188
00:54:54,600 --> 00:54:56,633
I'm leaving now. I'll go find...

1189
00:54:56,633 --> 00:54:57,233
Want company?

1190
00:54:57,233 --> 00:54:57,566
Take care.

1191
00:54:57,600 --> 00:54:58,633
I'll walk with you.

1192
00:54:58,633 --> 00:54:59,566
I'll walk with her!

1193
00:55:00,700 --> 00:55:02,533
Alright. Let's go. Bye!

1194
00:55:02,533 --> 00:55:04,800
[So Much Fun]

1195
00:55:04,833 --> 00:55:06,266
I didn't expect to come back.

1196
00:55:07,433 --> 00:55:08,833
But what you said today...

1197
00:55:08,833 --> 00:55:10,300
I didn't expect that either.

1198
00:55:10,300 --> 00:55:12,333
But I think what you did took guts.

1199
00:55:12,700 --> 00:55:13,633
Honestly, I was planning

1200
00:55:13,666 --> 00:55:14,933
to say it and just leave.

1201
00:55:14,933 --> 00:55:17,033
And I've actually been happy here.

1202
00:55:17,066 --> 00:55:18,400
I hope you can

1203
00:55:18,433 --> 00:55:19,866
all come back if there's a chance.

1204
00:55:21,300 --> 00:55:22,833
What do you want to talk about?

1205
00:55:22,866 --> 00:55:25,266
Nothing serious. Just wanted

1206
00:55:25,266 --> 00:55:26,966
to say thanks for voting for me today.

1207
00:55:27,000 --> 00:55:28,733
No problem. Welcome back.

1208
00:55:28,733 --> 00:55:29,266
Okay.

1209
00:55:29,300 --> 00:55:30,100
Welcome back!

1210
00:55:30,100 --> 00:55:31,733
This is your T-shirt?

1211
00:55:31,733 --> 00:55:33,566
Yeah, it is.

1212
00:55:33,600 --> 00:55:35,633
What's wrong?

1213
00:55:35,633 --> 00:55:37,566
Do you know whose brand it is?

1214
00:55:38,066 --> 00:55:38,966
Was it an impulse buy?

1215
00:55:39,000 --> 00:55:41,066
I know. Bai Jingting's brand, right?

1216
00:55:41,066 --> 00:55:42,766
I like Bai Jingting.

1217
00:55:42,800 --> 00:55:43,433
Oh really?

1218
00:55:43,433 --> 00:55:46,233
Yeah. I've liked him for about ten years.

1219
00:55:46,233 --> 00:55:47,133
Ten years?

1220
00:55:47,133 --> 00:55:47,933
Yeah.

1221
00:55:47,933 --> 00:55:49,466
A couple of days ago,

1222
00:55:49,500 --> 00:55:52,833
I saw it in the fitting room

1223
00:55:52,866 --> 00:55:54,866
when I got my clothes changed.

1224
00:55:54,866 --> 00:55:55,733
I was like,

1225
00:55:55,733 --> 00:55:57,033
"Who's got such good taste?"

1226
00:55:57,900 --> 00:55:58,633
It's mine.

1227
00:55:58,666 --> 00:55:59,500
When I left,

1228
00:55:59,500 --> 00:56:01,333
they didn't return it to me.

1229
00:56:02,200 --> 00:56:03,200
Such a coincidence.

1230
00:56:03,200 --> 00:56:04,433
Yeah. It is.

1231
00:56:04,433 --> 00:56:06,466
I just turned around and saw it.

1232
00:56:07,000 --> 00:56:09,233
That's almost too coincidental.

1233
00:56:10,433 --> 00:56:11,033
I think Xiaxia

1234
00:56:11,033 --> 00:56:12,300
needs that kind of intense,

1235
00:56:12,300 --> 00:56:15,133
wholehearted connection.

1236
00:56:15,133 --> 00:56:17,666
So I'm hoping I can

1237
00:56:17,700 --> 00:56:19,166
find various chances

1238
00:56:19,200 --> 00:56:20,233
to talk to her.

1239
00:56:20,233 --> 00:56:22,700
I won't pressure her.

1240
00:56:22,700 --> 00:56:23,800
Just start as friends

1241
00:56:23,833 --> 00:56:25,700
and slowly get closer.

1242
00:56:25,700 --> 00:56:26,533
That's the best way.

1243
00:56:32,466 --> 00:56:33,300
[Xia Boyan
Pan!]

1244
00:56:33,300 --> 00:56:34,300
[Pan Xiaoyi
Yes?]

1245
00:56:34,300 --> 00:56:35,366
[Pan Xiaoyi
What's up?]

1246
00:56:36,066 --> 00:56:37,900
These are Huihui's shoes.

1247
00:56:38,400 --> 00:56:40,333
[Delivering Shoes to Huihui]
She left them in Room 1

1248
00:56:40,333 --> 00:56:41,766
and never came back for them.

1249
00:56:41,800 --> 00:56:43,233
Alright. I'll bring them to her.

1250
00:56:43,233 --> 00:56:45,633
They got soaked outside, right?

1251
00:56:45,633 --> 00:56:46,766
Yeah, today.

1252
00:56:46,800 --> 00:56:48,233
Let her know when you give them to her.

1253
00:56:48,233 --> 00:56:49,166
Got it. I will.

1254
00:56:49,200 --> 00:56:49,600
Bye!

1255
00:56:49,600 --> 00:56:50,266
Bye!

1256
00:56:55,300 --> 00:56:59,100
[Carefully Cleaning Shoes]

1257
00:57:04,866 --> 00:57:05,600
All done.

1258
00:57:06,033 --> 00:57:08,300
[Mission Accomplished]

1259
00:57:11,633 --> 00:57:14,266
This is Autumn's gift for Tao.

1260
00:57:14,266 --> 00:57:15,400
[Used Again]

1261
00:57:15,466 --> 00:57:16,366
Sorry about that.

1262
00:57:16,400 --> 00:57:17,133
Come on.

1263
00:57:17,133 --> 00:57:18,233
[You're being bold.]

1264
00:57:20,066 --> 00:57:22,933
[Return Them to the Owner]

1265
00:57:26,033 --> 00:57:27,033
Huihui!

1266
00:57:27,033 --> 00:57:28,166
Why are you alone?

1267
00:57:28,200 --> 00:57:29,133
Going to vote.

1268
00:57:29,133 --> 00:57:29,866
I'll go with you.

1269
00:57:31,266 --> 00:57:33,500
He's been walking me there

1270
00:57:33,500 --> 00:57:34,800
since day three.

1271
00:57:34,833 --> 00:57:36,500
And he'll wait for me

1272
00:57:36,500 --> 00:57:37,566
and walk me back to the dorm.

1273
00:57:38,600 --> 00:57:39,800
How many girls did you vote for yesterday?

1274
00:57:39,800 --> 00:57:40,866
Three.

1275
00:57:40,866 --> 00:57:41,500
But you got the most.

1276
00:57:42,666 --> 00:57:44,333
I brought this in case you're hungry.

1277
00:57:44,733 --> 00:57:45,733
Where did you get it?

1278
00:57:45,733 --> 00:57:46,566
Magic.

1279
00:57:47,266 --> 00:57:49,366
You really had a bunch of random ideas.

1280
00:57:49,400 --> 00:57:50,133
You mean that game?

1281
00:57:50,666 --> 00:57:53,866
He's like a bodyguard,
escorting me every day.

1282
00:58:01,633 --> 00:58:02,166
The second one.

1283
00:58:04,000 --> 00:58:04,666
The third one.

1284
00:58:06,033 --> 00:58:09,566
[Pan Xiaoyi ←→ Duan Danhui: 3 Moonstones]

1285
00:58:10,233 --> 00:58:10,700
Tonight,

1286
00:58:10,700 --> 00:58:12,200
I voted for Pan again.

1287
00:58:12,233 --> 00:58:13,500
The reason is simple.

1288
00:58:13,500 --> 00:58:16,100
I'm happy when I'm with him.

1289
00:58:16,100 --> 00:58:18,133
I want to keep spending time together.

1290
00:58:18,500 --> 00:58:20,333
[Pan Xiaoyi]

1291
00:58:28,300 --> 00:58:31,133
[Kelvin Wang ←→ Pu Yanyan: 3 Moonstones]

1292
00:58:34,533 --> 00:58:35,733
[Offering Snacks]
Saved you some of this.

1293
00:58:35,733 --> 00:58:36,633
[Offering Snacks]
It's really good.

1294
00:58:36,666 --> 00:58:37,200
No, thanks.

1295
00:58:37,233 --> 00:58:38,100
I already had one.

1296
00:58:38,666 --> 00:58:39,700
It's seriously tasty.

1297
00:58:39,700 --> 00:58:41,133
No, I'm not hungry.

1298
00:58:41,133 --> 00:58:42,533
Save it for tomorrow, then.

1299
00:58:42,533 --> 00:58:43,600
You rejected me.

1300
00:58:43,633 --> 00:58:44,633
Now I'm sad.

1301
00:58:44,633 --> 00:58:46,733
[Eat It Immediately]
I'm quitting the show.

1302
00:58:46,733 --> 00:58:47,666
[Eat It Immediately]
I'm leaving now.

1303
00:58:50,533 --> 00:58:51,466
This flavor's good.

1304
00:58:51,500 --> 00:58:53,033
[Yum]
Right?

1305
00:58:53,066 --> 00:58:55,333
[Pu's makeup went to waste.]
The makeup was wasted today.

1306
00:58:55,333 --> 00:58:55,833
[Pu's makeup went to waste.]

1307
00:58:55,866 --> 00:58:57,500
The makeup was wasted.

1308
00:58:57,500 --> 00:58:59,433
I'll do it for you tomorrow.

1309
00:59:04,600 --> 00:59:06,733
You owe me two million.

1310
00:59:15,400 --> 00:59:16,066
What's up?

1311
00:59:17,433 --> 00:59:17,833
I know

1312
00:59:17,833 --> 00:59:19,266
you came back for Tao,

1313
00:59:20,000 --> 00:59:21,000
right?

1314
00:59:21,000 --> 00:59:21,433
Right?

1315
00:59:21,433 --> 00:59:22,233
Take a guess.

1316
00:59:22,233 --> 00:59:23,566
I'm guessing yes.

1317
00:59:23,600 --> 00:59:24,266
And?

1318
00:59:25,933 --> 00:59:26,966
How do I vote?

1319
00:59:31,200 --> 00:59:32,200
Wait a sec.

1320
00:59:34,033 --> 00:59:35,100
Why do you think so?

1321
00:59:36,033 --> 00:59:37,900
What made you say that?

1322
00:59:37,900 --> 00:59:39,300
I don't know.

1323
00:59:39,300 --> 00:59:41,366
I'm stuck. It's really hard.

1324
00:59:42,066 --> 00:59:43,466
I'm struggling.

1325
00:59:43,466 --> 00:59:44,866
What are you worried about?

1326
00:59:44,866 --> 00:59:46,266
What do you mean?

1327
00:59:46,266 --> 00:59:47,766
It's just...

1328
00:59:48,500 --> 00:59:50,833
But I just had a date with her yesterday.

1329
00:59:50,866 --> 00:59:52,000
She went on a date with you?

1330
00:59:52,033 --> 00:59:53,766
[Did Kong ask you for a date?]
There was no one else left.

1331
00:59:53,800 --> 00:59:54,733
Just the two of us.

1332
00:59:55,600 --> 00:59:57,266
That was yesterday.

1333
00:59:57,266 --> 00:59:58,533
I haven't talked to her today.

1334
01:00:02,666 --> 01:00:04,666
So how am I supposed to vote?

1335
01:00:04,666 --> 01:00:05,800
Then why didn't you vote for me?

1336
01:00:05,833 --> 01:00:07,066
Then why didn't you vote for me?

1337
01:00:07,066 --> 01:00:08,733
You're giving all your votes to Tao.

1338
01:00:08,733 --> 01:00:09,766
How can I vote for you?

1339
01:00:09,800 --> 01:00:10,466
Who told you

1340
01:00:10,466 --> 01:00:11,566
I was voting for Tao?

1341
01:00:11,600 --> 01:00:13,000
I guessed. That's why I asked.

1342
01:00:16,233 --> 01:00:17,666
Do you know who I voted for
the past two days?

1343
01:00:17,666 --> 01:00:18,266
Just tell me.

1344
01:00:18,266 --> 01:00:18,733
Please.

1345
01:00:18,733 --> 01:00:19,066
Yeah.

1346
01:00:19,100 --> 01:00:20,033
Yeah.

1347
01:00:20,066 --> 01:00:21,133
So why do you think

1348
01:00:21,133 --> 01:00:22,466
I'll give all my votes to Tao again?

1349
01:00:22,500 --> 01:00:24,366
Because you said you came back

1350
01:00:24,400 --> 01:00:25,266
to chase love.

1351
01:00:25,266 --> 01:00:26,666
So take a guess.

1352
01:00:26,666 --> 01:00:27,900
I think I can figure it out.

1353
01:00:27,900 --> 01:00:30,133
But I think...

1354
01:00:30,133 --> 01:00:32,466
Anyway, you can try guessing who

1355
01:00:32,500 --> 01:00:33,400
I want to get to know.

1356
01:00:33,433 --> 01:00:36,366
[Guess who I want to know better.]

1357
01:00:48,866 --> 01:00:50,966
[Yao Qianyu
gave ??? 2 Moonstones]

1358
01:00:53,400 --> 01:00:56,933
[Yao Qianyu
gave ??? 3 Moonstones]

1359
01:00:56,933 --> 01:01:00,000
[Who is Qianyu's choice?]

1360
01:01:09,700 --> 01:01:12,200
[Yao Qianyu]

1361
01:01:15,066 --> 01:01:17,300
[Kong Xichen]

1362
01:01:26,666 --> 01:01:28,166
[Kong Xichen]

1363
01:01:28,200 --> 01:01:30,700
[Sun Shuo
gave Kong Xichen 2 Moonstones]

1364
01:01:35,033 --> 01:01:37,300
[Yao Qianyu]

1365
01:01:39,900 --> 01:01:41,100
[Yao Qianyu]

1366
01:01:41,100 --> 01:01:43,100
[Sun Shuo
gave Yao Qianyu 1 Moonstone]

1367
01:01:43,800 --> 01:01:45,300
I gave two Moonstones to Kong

1368
01:01:45,300 --> 01:01:46,333
and one to Qianyu.

1369
01:01:46,333 --> 01:01:47,266
My relationship

1370
01:01:47,300 --> 01:01:49,700
with Qianyu has always been

1371
01:01:49,700 --> 01:01:51,800
a solid friendship.

1372
01:01:51,833 --> 01:01:53,433
What she said today

1373
01:01:53,433 --> 01:01:55,333
really moved me.

1374
01:01:55,333 --> 01:01:57,133
She was brave and kind,

1375
01:01:57,133 --> 01:01:58,433
and I'm glad

1376
01:01:58,466 --> 01:01:59,200
she came back. So I gave her a vote.

1377
01:01:59,233 --> 01:02:00,666
So I voted for her.

1378
01:02:04,400 --> 01:02:05,333
I was so happy

1379
01:02:05,333 --> 01:02:06,600
that you came back.

1380
01:02:06,633 --> 01:02:07,900
We could choose

1381
01:02:07,900 --> 01:02:09,200
to come back or not.

1382
